{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f6fbda63e477b0e18aea522afe9e32805758b6cb7a056b87b69d340605348db", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の公演の準備を進めないとな。\nえーと、麗花は……お、いたいた）", "zh": "（差不多该准备举办下次公演了。\n呃──丽花在……喔，在这里。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1001_p", "source_sha256": "143cea6c7fee6883086daeedadee041d642920440722b316c08211b32f4c20e8", "ja": "お疲れさま、麗花。\n次の公演のことなんだが……取り込み中か？", "zh": "辛苦了，丽花。\n我想找你商量下次公演……你们在忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "a42e03c4d724686cbe446f489c195ecc244873ee7ff2183fe6f02db8b039f4a0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いいところに♪\n私、紬ちゃんとパンダユニットを組みたいです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你来得正好♪\n我想和小䌷组成熊猫团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1003_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "44c6fd0d8f0f0311df10961203e279f1c2d18900f5214d19aabdcaf368749d00", "ja": "ぱ、パンダユニット……？", "zh": "熊、熊猫团体……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "2779a23d48670ad7aa89af893b71bb47bc0929f43212de42ae1b6432cc6901e6", "ja": "そう！　紬ちゃんと私で、七夕でしょ？\nで、七夕といえば笹の葉で～♪", "zh": "没错！小䌷，你和我不是七夕组合吗？\n然后，说到七夕就想到竹叶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "b0b5d60ac06815d3e35e863bbc2b3e5664e532effa5debd6e9d34d184966d11b", "ja": "笹の葉といえばパンダですから、\nパンダユニットです！　素敵ですよね♪", "zh": "说到竹叶就想到熊猫，\n所以就是熊猫团体！很棒吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c0ca1f965b67ea18ec0f2e9cde8d4995ebf38cb624a99969d37555622dc54d23", "ja": "なるほど。\n……紬、どういうことだ？", "zh": "原来如此。\n……䌷，这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "65a7f2acf74b609de3de0e5e621e737720a3d0535b082d6ba2a4ca1e69306f3b", "ja": "どうって、その……。\n人に聞く前に、もっとご自分で考えてくださいっ。", "zh": "怎么回事？这……\n你要问人之前，请先自己多动动脑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "e6c3412a41c5c666c5377ffb0b95c14ff4fb0422e55e4526618ade6703169fb3", "ja": "紬ちゃん、パンダ見たことないの？\n白くて黒くて大きくて、笹の葉が大好きなクマだよ！", "zh": "小䌷，你没看过熊猫吗？\n是又白又黑又大只，很喜欢吃竹叶的熊喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b521e270b6dcb6951056d93983c3059f1184e6bf5bbe66f4b15ecfadecd27bed", "ja": "い、いいえ。パンダは見たことがありますし、\nどういう生き物かも知ってはいますが……。", "zh": "不、不是的。\n我看过熊猫，也知道牠是怎样的生物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2769ccd19c1410010f7d78e600301f176cd36be9ce2959da2dc8397d17adb0b0", "ja": "うーん……。よし、わかった！", "zh": "嗯……好，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "821716a70d254abefd121e4f1015bae70c9d15acbab6bb0f3e7c0061477c21b0", "ja": "えっ！？　いつもは驚くほど察しの悪い方なのに、\n何かお分かりになったのですか？", "zh": "什么！？你平时总是迟钝得惊人，\n现在却突然领悟了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e6e13c4fe68a25128b4b18aade8f319509f8426449c7a0bf076ef9e0fc748b71", "ja": "いや……麗花がパンダユニットをやりたいことだけは、\nよくわかったよ。それが何かはともかく。", "zh": "没有啦……我只是知道丽花为何会想组熊猫团体了。\n虽然我不知道那是什么东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a6c0cdff41617e6b866397bb565e92c7a22de268f54c99850880a3ad9d7aeac1", "ja": "で、まあ、それはいいとして。", "zh": "不过，总之呢，这件事先放一边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8ff2efa82aeb7ae13454f7794228b54dd7698f70a43fa34865dac0696975125d", "ja": "いいのですか……？", "zh": "要先放一边吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c9cf9bbe584a146081bedc111f552202e5b2bfb5fff8d8d932a53b1ddaa576fe", "ja": "次の公演は、麗花にセンターを任せたいと思ってる。\nつまり、麗花自身が主役のステージだ。", "zh": "我想把下次公演的Center交给丽花。\n也就是说，下次将是丽花自己担任舞台主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "3dadf9f1388677deae626240c575252ead59238a2a07c7c6e7ab1d91aaf9d35a", "ja": "わぁ～！\nいいんですか、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "耶～！\n你确定吗？{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0b48deca152804236dd62a64bed8a9c586c99a63df075cbd9f5207ea78e29565", "ja": "もちろん。パンダユニットじゃないけど、\n代わりに麗花らしさを押し出すステージ、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "那当然。虽然不是熊猫团体，\n但会是宣传丽花特色的表演，拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "77f7b111c8a79ccc313605765eb5e30cc4370bb420f4192c43f02b69ef31de90", "ja": "はーい、頼まれちゃいました♪　ふふ、私をセンターに\n選ぶだなんて、お目が高いたかーいですね♪", "zh": "好──我被拜托了♪\n呵呵，会挑选我当Center，真是慧眼识丽花呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "54882273a2b631767739fadc265b3320c6808ca3f1c9a7998f29e0171f23e6de", "ja": "私、精いっぱい頑張ります♪\nどんどんどん、ぱふぱふー♪", "zh": "我会尽全力加油的♪\n咚咚咚，叭噗叭噗──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6c73c3bec90daec42d14fe50dde455fc9d930361ffd82f57ac15b8efd80782fe", "ja": "そういうことですか……良かった……。\n北上さん、センターおめでとうございます。", "zh": "原来是这样子……太好了……\n北上，恭喜你担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b7f6c74bfe1a0dd12a52746990de0ceb405debb0251f9438333abf0b59fc9b11", "ja": "歌もダンスもとても伸びやかで、はじけるように明るい\n北上さんが、ひときわ大きく輝くステージ……。", "zh": "北上的歌曲和舞蹈都十分轻松自在，开朗有活力，\n在担任Center的舞台上将绽放更为耀眼的光辉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "90c29cf8c12623f8dadcb943104b4c1d83064746dc8cf68845c7031acc766496", "ja": "きっと、素晴らしいものになりますね。\n私も、楽しみにしています！", "zh": "到时一定会是一场很棒的公演。\n我也很期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "1dc063cfb8d853aea62adcf33fe150d5546ac2d44c1a4da41abc98d0d8cefb1f", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう紬ちゃん！\n私もすっごく、楽しみだよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你，小䌷！\n我也非常期待喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5f32f03c90f74055a3ac87ad47151c5429e043504350aa8d77258edf4c08f8ad", "ja": "紬も、サポートをよろしくな。\nステージにもダンサーとして立ってもらうから。", "zh": "䌷，也要麻烦你协助了。\n这次公演你也要上台担任舞群。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "03be3b947326027973a1bf4f78cc0ae91fb1a36f6adee9c1334cfab4684187e6", "ja": "お任せください。微力ながら北上さんを\nしっかりサポートして……ダンサー……", "zh": "请交给我吧。\n我很乐意为北上略尽棉薄之……你说舞群……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8f88ec72b5017dbe6818f510d8ed76fa01a8cd4e07843c58f860727b8d1a7040", "ja": "ダンサー？　北上さんのステージのダンサー？？\nそ、そんな重大な役目を、私が務めるのですか？", "zh": "舞群？北上这次表演的舞群？？\n如、如此重责大任，我真的能胜任吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1028_p", "source_sha256": "fe585f1866aba76aee51c518743fdd944d7bc675b886cfe662bae13a6f9fc9b8", "ja": "ん？　もちろん紬だけじゃなくて、他にも強力な\n助っ人がいるんだ。ふたりとも、来てくれ！", "zh": "嗯？当然不只䌷一个人，还有其他强力帮手。\n两位，进来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "34b204d83d86ee1d589ec8327e9df76a9985535b3ca0f13efac0b990770062cf", "ja": "こんにちは、瑞希の助っ人です。あ、間違えました。\n……訂正します。助っ人の瑞希です。", "zh": "大家好，我是瑞希的帮手。啊，讲错了。\n……订正，我是帮手瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "383853edde1bee510ed3a5e17fa3a85cec1a0ee923e4df2c2d72c91b574aecca", "ja": "北上さん、白石さん。\nどうぞよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "北上、白石，\n请多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "87d5a39d04a6d8c0d88cd670700605a981cce7de1c774fde26cc948b5e80cbaf", "ja": "そしてそして……。最後にして最強な助っ人とは！\n誰だ……一体、誰なんだ！？", "zh": "然后然后……最后而且最强的帮手是──！\n是谁……究竟是谁！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "4d3f5873a35a82e461e5c88ad64c8ab8edc27cc91c18a4f3c5da095de7d6d951", "ja": "じゃじゃーん、正体は茜ちゃんです！　はい拍手ー！\n皆の者、茜ちゃんの強力助っ人っぷりを刮目して見よ！", "zh": "锵锵～她就是小茜！掌声鼓励鼓励～！\n请各位睁大眼睛，准备看小茜担任强力帮手的英姿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "84777ac3142858cd26e7b043fadc283d31f22f5b21a3fb5b214b84e70d359c92", "ja": "わぁ、茜ちゃんだ♪\nこちらこそ、よろしくね！", "zh": "哇！是小茜♪\n彼此彼此，请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fb4db9cda783f12ca8074c4848058ea4a91ed5e1bf6ee0b24705c746950ad4b1", "ja": "真壁さんに、野々原さんも……。\nそんなステージに、うちが……。大丈夫なん……？", "zh": "是真壁与野野原……\n我要加入这样的阵容……真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_029_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_029_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ffe1e2e662980fe8b588655664caf59a7e39e05002ec63064d0142aa457953b3", "ja": "（このメンバーなら、麗花を存分に刺激してくれる\nだろう。さて、どんな化学反応が起こるかな……）", "zh": "（这些成员对丽花来说应该是很好的刺激，\n就让我来看看会发生怎样的化学反应呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
